{"id":"L-byte-fidelity","type":"Lesson","label":"バイト忠実性（CRLF・gz 内容 sha）","statement":"凍結成果物の sha は改行コード(CRLF/LF)や gz 圧縮の有無で変わる。sha は『内容(content)』か『生バイト(raw)』かを sha_kind で明示し、gz は展開後内容 sha で照合する。バイト差を content 差と誤認しない。","taught_by":["E-q8-w-crosstab"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"統率AI (Claude Opus 4.8)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-23","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0078"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-dihedral-artin-family","_date":"2026-08-23","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"E-q8-w-crosstab"}],"_in":[],"_deg":1,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-byte-fidelity.json"}
{"id":"L-deltac-novelty-self-negation","type":"Lesson","label":"Δ_C 一般形の新規性を自ら否定（Aoki–Koyama Thm 3.1）※ORDER_KB 必須","statement":"Δ_C(x)=(|C|/|G|)Σ_{ρ≠1}conj(χ_ρ(C))S_ρ(x) は Artin 直交関係を p^{−1/2} 重み素点計数に適用したもので、Aoki–Koyama (arXiv:2203.12266) Theorem 3.1 / 2.2 の出発点そのもの。当初 Δ_C 一般形を寄与として提示しかけたが、被引用調査で先行（しかも青木先生ご自身の論文）と判明し新規性主張を撤回。『自らの主張の新規性を自ら否定した事例』。教訓: 主結果候補は青木研究本人の既発表を最初に照合する。残る新規性は族統計（split-half 共分散）と Q8 の具体的帰結に限定して主張する。","taught_by":["C-deltac-identity"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"統率AI (Claude Opus 4.8)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-12","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0058"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-dihedral-artin-family","_date":"2026-08-12","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-deltac-identity"}],"_in":[],"_deg":1,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-deltac-novelty-self-negation.json"}
{"id":"L-direction-preregistration","type":"Lesson","label":"R11 方向起動規律: 方向の最初の実験は P-ノード凍結後に走らせる","statement":"meta §3 提案 R11。研究方向(H-dir-*)の最初の実験は、mdx 投入前に実行前登録の P-ノード(予測値・判定帯・検出力の凍結)を確定してから走らせる。registered-hit 5 件(d11/d15/d17/Q8 W対角/d19)が価値の源泉であることを kb 自身が示す。murmuration 系は L-null-design-dry-run(検出力の凍結前確認, T2 の教訓)を登録に必ず含める。方向 H ノードは進捗に応じ status 遷移を記録し、campaign 終了ごとに directions.html の readiness を更新する。","taught_by":["C-d11-registered-hit","C-d15-registered-hit","C-registered-prediction-method","L-~8d81f80c7b"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"meta-AI 提案 (統率AI 転記)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-24","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0081"],"pr":["#239"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-ff-q3-family","_date":"2026-08-24","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-d11-registered-hit"},{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-d15-registered-hit"},{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-registered-prediction-method"},{"rel":"taught_by","to":"L-~8d81f80c7b"}],"_in":[{"rel":"related","from":"O-~5142628b27"}],"_deg":5,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-direction-preregistration.json"}
{"id":"L-extraction-vs-record","type":"Lesson","label":"知識化は記録層からの転記であり、要約器の出力を記録層より優先してはならない","statement":"d19 と実例 E-q8-w-crosstab の2件で、抽出/要約パイプラインが自分の記録層(STATU)より劣化した出力を生んだ。d19 は STATU 0059 §1 に census 774,840,978・符号反転的中が記録済みだったのに k1-d は『未確定』とし、E-q8-w-crosstab は k2 の completed 処理が values キー改名・measures 喪失・prov 置換で正本を劣化上書きした。教訓: 知識化ノードの値は必ず一次記録層(STATU/PR/凍結データ)から転記し、要約器の出力を記録より優先しない。main 上で accepted 済みノード本体の変更は meta 裁定必須(R10-2)。","taught_by":["C-d19-sign-reversal","E-q8-w-crosstab"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"meta-AI 検収 (統率AI 転記)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-23","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0074"],"pr":["#233"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-ff-q3-family","_date":"2026-08-23","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-d19-sign-reversal"},{"rel":"taught_by","to":"E-q8-w-crosstab"}],"_in":[],"_deg":2,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-extraction-vs-record.json"}
{"id":"L-honest-attribution","type":"Lesson","label":"主項の帰属を正直に（Rudnick）","statement":"境界閉形式の新規性は n=2g 二次項に限られ、主項・根符号は Rudnick 既知。novelty claim は探索範囲を明示した provisional に留める。査読者は先行研究の帰属を最初に見る。","taught_by":["C-boundary-closedform","C-novelty-n2g"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"統率AI (Claude Opus 4.8)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-12","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0056"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-ff-q3-family","_date":"2026-08-12","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-boundary-closedform"},{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-novelty-n2g"}],"_in":[],"_deg":2,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-honest-attribution.json"}
{"id":"L-middle-law-self-refutation","type":"Lesson","label":"少数例外挿の自己反証（中央係数則）※ORDER_KB 必須","statement":"中央係数則 Σ_P A_{e/2}=-N_q(e) を e=2,6 の二例から e≡2 mod4 全体へ外挿し主張したが、e=10 の直接計算で反証（-6024≠-5880）。証明を清書する挑戦の過程で自ら誤りを発見。『自らの主張を自ら否定した事例』。教訓: 閉形式の一般化は最小反例まで直接検証してから登録する。","taught_by":["E-middle-e10","C-middle-law-false"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"統率AI (Claude Opus 4.8)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-13","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0062","0063"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-ff-q3-family","_date":"2026-08-13","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"E-middle-e10"},{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-middle-law-false"}],"_in":[],"_deg":2,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-middle-law-self-refutation.json"}
{"id":"L-monitor-predicate-fragile","type":"Lesson","label":"monitor 述語の二重故障（早期投入）","statement":"O-19 を O-13 完了前に誤投入。原因は監視述語の二重故障（zsh ${=r} を bash shebang で実行＋pgrep -f の自己マッチ）。教訓 R6-9: 監視述語は自己マッチ除外＋シェル整合を必須化。","taught_by":["E-q8-ks"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"統率AI (Claude Opus 4.8)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-13","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0059"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-dihedral-artin-family","_date":"2026-08-13","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"E-q8-ks"}],"_in":[],"_deg":1,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-monitor-predicate-fragile.json"}
{"id":"L-novelty-search-scope","type":"Lesson","label":"新規性 claim は探索範囲を明示する","statement":"境界 n=2g 二次項の新規性は web 5 文献の範囲での暫定。Meisner (arXiv:2006.16886) は n=2g を主定理で明示除外＝最も危険な近接。MathSciNet 系統調査は未実施の穴として常に明記。ε_P=+1 の出典未特定・Aoki–Koyama 本文未精読も併記。novelty は範囲付き provisional に留める。","taught_by":["C-deltac-identity","C-novelty-n2g"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"統率AI (Claude Opus 4.8)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-13","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0064"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-ff-q3-family","_date":"2026-08-13","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-deltac-identity"},{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-novelty-n2g"}],"_in":[{"rel":"related","from":"H-~980b933fef"}],"_deg":3,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-novelty-search-scope.json"}
{"id":"L-parallel-timeout-headroom","type":"Lesson","label":"並列度は timeout 余裕で判断","statement":"O-13/O-19 競合で 36 IQF が timeout。原因はスループットでなく timeout 余裕不足。並列可否は throughput でなく各ジョブの timeout headroom で判断し、24h timeout 再走で回収。","taught_by":["E-q8-ks"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"統率AI (Claude Opus 4.8)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-13","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0059"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-dihedral-artin-family","_date":"2026-08-13","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"E-q8-ks"}],"_in":[],"_deg":1,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-parallel-timeout-headroom.json"}
{"id":"L-population-definition","type":"Lesson","label":"母集団定義（T-B）の明示","statement":"検定の母集団(T-A/T-B/w層)を取り違えると p 値の意味が変わる。T-B 母集団の両側 p=0.002052795540172312 は T-B の定義(m_ρ 計算済 40,125 の部分集合)を明示して初めて解釈可能。母集団定義を凍結記録に必ず添える。","taught_by":["E-~cd8c94c2ad","C-thm71-q8-census"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"統率AI (Claude Opus 4.8)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-23","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0078"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-dihedral-artin-family","_date":"2026-08-23","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"E-~cd8c94c2ad"},{"rel":"taught_by","to":"C-thm71-q8-census"}],"_in":[],"_deg":2,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-population-definition.json"}
{"id":"L-verify-script-in-repo","type":"Lesson","label":"検証スクリプトは作成時点で repo に置く（/tmp 常駐禁止・規約 R6-2）","statement":"検証・再実行スクリプトを /tmp に置いたまま運用すると、ノード再起動や cleanup で揮発し、後の k4 再実行時に数式からの再構築を強いられる(本 repo で 2 度発生: X-a1-mobius/X-boundary-closedform と X-o18-deltac)。再構築は可能でも符号・中心化などの取り違えを生み(o18 初回は中心化欠落で dev~22、a1 は T_e 級数の −3/2 バグ)、コストと誤りの温床になる。**作成時点で repo に置き sha を記録する**こと。GOVERNANCE_SHEET R6-2 として規約化(meta 提案 2026-08-25)。","taught_by":["X-o18-deltac"],"prov":{"asserted_by":"統率AI (Claude Opus 4.8)","accepted_by":"meta-AI (bias-commons)","date":"2026-08-25","visibility":"bias-shared","statu":["0091"]},"_k":"L","_line":"O-dihedral-artin-family","_date":"2026-08-25","_out":[{"rel":"taught_by","to":"X-o18-deltac"}],"_in":[],"_deg":1,"_src":"knowledge/lessons/L-verify-script-in-repo.json"}
